 compatibility setting is enabled.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\nRegression in 4.7-dev: keyboard/mouse events now default to device IDs 16/32, which breaks projects that relied on device=0. Fixes #118025.\r\n\r\n## Technical overview\r\n- Add a project setting: input_devices/compatibility/legacy_keyboard_mouse_device_ids.\r\n- Auto-enable it for projects created before 4.7.\r\n- When enabled, normalize keyboard/mouse events to device=0 at input dispatch and in InputMap event storage.\r\n- Keep the new IDs as the default for new projects.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nNot run (code change + unit test update only).\r\n\r\n## AI disclosure\r\nThis PR description was assisted by an AI tool.\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\nNone. Default behavior stays the same for new projects.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-31T16:14:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T23:28:42Z","closed_at":"2026-04-01T22:53:45Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fdeaf34f43f5714a036821a4dbee64f60f1d8e5a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requeste